type":"Paragraph","text":"Designed to handle all of your cooking needs with a powerful 3,200 Watt EvenTemp® Element and convenient bridge element."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Slow Cook"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"With Slow Cook, your food cooks slowly and at a lower temperature (as low as 100° F), allowing you to lock in moisture and flavor without over or undercooking your food."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Steam Bake"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"With Steam Bake, steam evenly circulates throughout the oven cavity, resulting in breads and muffins that rise higher and are light and fluffy."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Steam Roast"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Steam Roast uses moisture to make perfectly crispy and tender meats and vegetables that are roasted to perfection."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Bridge Element"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Connects two elements to create a larger cooking surface, perfect for a griddle or large pan."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Temperature Probe"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Monitors and alerts when the desired finished cooking temperature has been reached."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Self and Steam Clean Cycles"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Enjoy more cleaning flexibility. Select Steam Clean for a quick, 30 minute clean or choose Self Clean, which is available in 2, 3 and 4 hour cycles."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Backlit LED Knobs"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Lights up when the burner is turned on."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Premium Glide Rack"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Our extending Glide Rack makes it easier to monitor and lift your food out of the oven."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Extra Large Oven Capacity"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Cook more at once with our extra large, 6.2 cu. ft. capacity oven."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Smudge-Proof® Stainless Steel"},{"type":"Paragraph","text":"Resists fingerprints and cleans easily."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Proudly Assembled in the USA"}],"documents":[{"label":"Q